8800, "avatar": "f68d173e76688c176b3d6f2a32f9f37df54f912c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Overall 4/5\n\nIt’s free so…why not? The game itself is fun, even though it becomes a bit repetitive. You can enjoy the game, and perform well, without requiring everyone on your team to be a pro. It’s a refreshing change from most team based games that can be completely ruined by one bad player. The levelling system could use a bit of work, and more “boss” style enemies could be added, but overall, it’s just a fun shoot-‘em-up game. Fun without friends, more fun with.\n", "timestamp_created": 1431458443, "timestamp_updated": 1431458443, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}